Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(web): floating chat panel for writing in your voice

A floating Claude chat (Shift+Cmd+I, or Chat in the composer status bar) that
minimizes to a pill and lists past chats. Chats are ordinary threads in a
~/Chat project, so CLAUDE.md, voice.md and memory there shape every reply;
that project is hidden from the sidebar.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
